# Promo mid-size run, arm C: llama-quantize alone (mainline 78feec062, 64 threads) from the MXFP4 source to the final file, the
# reference. [derived] 3.028e11 / 2.14e8 (measured on K3.1, contended) = 1415 s, the trunk's 5.9e9 Q8_0 weights at most 28 s (the IQ
# rate as an upper bound), the read (104 s) and the 63 GB write (42 s) under the compute: ~1445 s; band from the K3.1 rate band
